Package: tidyschoolvax
Type: Package
Title: Preprocessing and Data Quality Assurance for School Vaccination Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("ACCIDDA Team", email = "contact@accidda.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides modular functions for preprocessing, cleaning, and 
    quality assurance of state-level school vaccination data. The package 
    standardizes data formats across states and implements comprehensive 
    data quality checks for measles, mumps, and rubella (MMR) vaccination 
    coverage data from kindergarten enrollment records.
